==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn, delay 60~73.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

